  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_weaver_1_0": "Increase Geminate Attack Damage: 15/30/45",
    "modifier_weaver_1_1": "Increase Geminate Attack Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>15</font></b>/30/45",
    "modifier_weaver_1_2": "Increase Geminate Attack Damage: 15/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b>/45",
    "modifier_weaver_1_3": "Increase Geminate Attack Damage: 15/30/<b><font color='#eabe10'>45</font></b>",
    "modifier_weaver_2_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Remove The Swarm.</font></b> \n\n Geminate Attack triggers on all enemies within a 300 radius. \n\n Geminate Attack reduces armor targets: 3 \n\n Duration: 7 seconds",
    "modifier_weaver_2_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Remove The Swarm.</font></b> \n\n Geminate Attack triggers on all enemies within a <b><font color='#eabe10'>300</font></b> radius. \n\n Geminate Attack reduces armor targets: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> \n\n Duration: 7 seconds",
    "modifier_weaver_3_0": "Shukuchi consumes Health, not Mana. \n\n After exiting, Shukuchi uses Geminate Attack on all enemies affected by the ability.",
    "modifier_weaver_3_1": "Shukuchi consumes <b><font color='#eabe10'>Health</font></b>, not Mana. \n\n After exiting, Shukuchi uses <b><font color='#eabe10'>Geminate Attack</font></b> on all enemies affected by the ability.",
    "modifier_weaver_4_0": "New Active Ability: Weaver Snare \n\n Creates a web at a specified point, which, when it hits an enemy, inflicts root. The trigger interval for each target is 6 seconds. \n\n Radius: 300 \n Web duration: 10 seconds \n Root Duration: 1/2/3 seconds \n Cooldown: 15 seconds",
    "modifier_weaver_4_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Weaver Snare</font></b> \n\n Creates a web at a specified point, which, when it hits an enemy, inflicts root. The trigger interval for each target is 6 seconds. \n\n Radius: 300 \n Web duration: 10 seconds \n Root Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2/3 seconds \n Cooldown: 15 seconds",
    "modifier_weaver_4_2": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Weaver Snare</font></b> \n\n Creates a web at a specified point, which, when it hits an enemy, inflicts root. The trigger interval for each target is 6 seconds. \n\n Radius: 300 \n Web duration: 10 seconds \n Root Duration: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/3 seconds \n Cooldown: 15 seconds",
    "modifier_weaver_4_3": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Weaver Snare</font></b> \n\n Creates a web at a specified point, which, when it hits an enemy, inflicts root. The trigger interval for each target is 6 seconds. \n\n Radius: 300 \n Web duration: 10 seconds \n Root Duration: 1/2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> seconds \n Cooldown: 15 seconds",
    "modifier_weaver_5_0": "Lifesteal: 6%/12%/18%",
    "modifier_weaver_5_1": "Lifesteal: <b><font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b>/12%/18%",
    "modifier_weaver_5_2": "Lifesteal: 6%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>12%</font></b>/18%",
    "modifier_weaver_5_3": "Lifesteal: 6%/12%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>18%</font></b>",
    "modifier_weaver_6_0": "Weaver Snare deals Magic Damage when hitting an enemy: 200%/400% of Strength",
    "modifier_weaver_6_1": "Weaver Snare deals Magic Damage when hitting an enemy: <b><font color='#eabe10'>200%</font></b>/400% of Strength",
    "modifier_weaver_6_2": "Weaver Snare deals Magic Damage when hitting an enemy: 200%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>400%</font></b> of Strength",
    "modifier_weaver_7_0": "Increase Geminate Attack: 1",
    "modifier_weaver_7_1": "Increase Geminate Attack: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>",
    "modifier_weaver_8_0": "Increase The Swarm Damage: 4/8/12",
    "modifier_weaver_8_1": "Increase The Swarm Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b>/8/12",
    "modifier_weaver_8_2": "Increase The Swarm Damage: 4/<b><font color='#eabe10'>8</font></b>/12",
    "modifier_weaver_8_3": "Increase The Swarm Damage: 4/8/<b><font color='#eabe10'>12</font></b>",
    "modifier_weaver_9_0": "New Passive Ability: Auto Swarm \n\n A bugs from The Swarm ability flies around the hero and shoots at a random enemy nearby. Selects the farthest target in radius. The attack radius is equal to your attack radius. Maximum stacks of armor reduction from Auto Swarm: 6\n\n Armor Reduction Duration: 6 sec.\n\n Will create an additional swarm if the hero has more than 300 Agility.",
